{"root":{"data":{"id":"dldte2wisxk0","created":1789264672233,"text":"血液的一般检查"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"dldtf2310f40","created":1789264748813,"text":"血常规检测概况","layout":null},"children":[{"data":{"id":"dldtkzw0nzc0","created":1789265214221,"text":"血常规检测标本","layout":null},"children":[{"data":{"id":"dldtl4atytc0","created":1789265223824,"text":"采血方法：静脉采血法，毛细血管采血","layout":null},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"dldtnxhjk4g0","created":1789265444085,"text":"采样体积：2ml/≥200ul","layout":null},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"dldto0mg5hs0","created":1789265450912,"text":"紫管抗凝：常用EDTA K2（终浓度为1.5~2.2mg/ml），一般不用枸橼酸钠或肝素","layout":null},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"dldto32c9340","created":1789265456226,"text":"样本保存：室温下18℃~25℃，2~3h（不超过24h）","layout":null},"children":[]}]}]},{"data":{"id":"dldtlvkn4n40","created":1789265283190,"text":"RBC的检测","layout":null},"children":[{"data":{"id":"dldtm23u3ow0","created":1789265297411,"text":"量的检测","layout":null,"expandState":"collapse"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"dldtmbiecxk0","created":1789265317883,"text":"个数——红细胞数量RBC：测定单位体积血液中红细胞的数量（10^{12}/L）","layout":null},"children":[{"data":{"id":"dldtnd8v7ns0","created":1789265400024,"text":"方法：：自动血细胞计数仪、显微镜计数法","layout":null},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"dldtnho9otk0","created":1789265409663,"text":"参考值","layout":null},"children":[{"data":{"id":"dldtnl47gt40","created":1789265417157,"text":"成年女性：3.5~5.0x10^{12}/L","layout":null},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"dldtnot1p480","created":1789265425189,"text":"成年男性：4~5.5x10^{12}/L","layout":null},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"dldtnru7jj40","created":1789265431790,"text":"新生儿：6.0~7.0x10^{12}/L","layout":null},"children":[]}]}]},{"data":{"id":"dldtpedlh7c0","created":1789265559215,"text":"有效分子含量——血红蛋白浓度HGB：血液中各种血红蛋白的综合浓度单位以g/L表示","layout":null},"children":[{"data":{"id":"dldtpvhz88o0","created":1789265596486,"text":"  方法：比色法、比重法、血氧法、测铁法，常用氧化高铁血红蛋白测定法","layout":null},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"dldtq2jtx600","created":1789265611835,"text":"参考值","layout":null},"children":[{"data":{"id":"dldtq8pvsp40","created":1789265625262,"text":"成年女性： 110 ～ 150 g /L","layout":null},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"dldtqdw42xk0","created":1789265636523,"text":"  成年男性： 120 ～ 160 g /L","layout":null},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"dldtqgt6cug0","created":1789265642875,"text":"     新 生 儿： 170 ～ 200 g /L","layout":null},"children":[]}]},{"data":{"id":"dldtqp2mfk00","created":1789265660861,"text":"临床意义","layout":null},"children":[{"data":{"id":"dldtqu6ardk0","created":1789265671967,"text":"增高\n成人男性 \n RBC > 6.0×10^{12}/L   Hb>170g/L\n成年女性  \nRBC> 5.5×10^{12}/L   Hb>170g/L","font-weight":"bold","layout":null},"children":[{"data":{"id":"dldtqyqe3ao0","created":1789265681889,"text":"相对性增高","layout":null},"children":[{"data":{"id":"dldtsevfz5c0","created":1789265795387,"text":"血浆中水份丢失，使有形成分相对增多，如呕吐、大面积烧伤","layout":null},"children":[]}]},{"data":{"id":"dldtsizcsao0","created":1789265804331,"text":"绝对性增高","layout":null},"children":[{"data":{"id":"dldtspdv4vc0","created":1789265818269,"text":"生理性：高原人、新生儿","layout":null},"children":[{"data":{"id":"dldtt0hgc0w0","created":1789265842430,"text":"大气氧分压低，Epo促红细胞生成素增多（主要是由肾脏的肾小球球旁细胞即肾间质细胞分泌产生的），促进骨髓造血，RBC增多","layout":null},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"dldttbc49ko0","created":1789265866052,"text":"婴幼儿与成年人的Hb含量不同","layout":null},"children":[{"data":{"id":"dldttksuj0g0","created":1789265886655,"text":"与之相关的疾病：新生儿黄疸。\n机制：宫内胎盘供氧氧分压低，胎儿被迫造大量红细胞；出生后肺呼吸建立，血氧明显升高，不再需要这么多红细胞，大量胎儿红细胞被机体破坏，释放血红蛋白生成胆红素，引发新生儿生理性黄疸，一般一周后胆红素可以降低，或者是降到正常，如果不降可能是病理性的黄疸","layout":null},"children":[]}]}]},{"data":{"id":"dldtuhzklx40","created":1789265958895,"text":"病理性：","layout":null},"children":[{"data":{"id":"dldtuuyht9s0","created":1789265987128,"text":"严重的心肺疾患、真性RBC增多症，某些肿瘤（子宫肌瘤、肾肿瘤、肝癌、肾癌均可引发EPO增多）","layout":null},"children":[]}]}]}]},{"data":{"id":"dldtv4th6fc0","created":1789266008593,"text":"降低","layout":null},"children":[{"data":{"id":"dldtv86nilc0","created":1789266015920,"text":"生理性","layout":null},"children":[{"data":{"id":"dldtvbx8yao0","created":1789266024058,"text":"妊娠妇女:血容量增加、血液稀释","layout":null},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"dldtvmqemnc0","created":1789266047589,"text":"儿童：6个月~2岁，生长发育快，造血原料不足","layout":null},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"dldtvpyugrc0","created":1789266054630,"text":"   老年人：造血功能减退","layout":null},"children":[]}]},{"data":{"id":"dldtvt7ibko0","created":1789266061684,"text":"病理性","layout":null},"children":[{"data":{"id":"dldtvvz42hs0","created":1789266067707,"text":"贫血","layout":null},"children":[]}]}]}]}]},{"data":{"id":"dldtw8urh4o0","created":1789266095742,"text":"体积——红细胞比容HCT：将一定量抗凝血离心沉淀后，测定压紧的RBC在全血中所占体积百分比，称之RBC比积/比容","layout":null},"children":[{"data":{"id":"dldtwjigm400","created":1789266118943,"text":"方法：HCT与RBC的数量及大小有关","layout":null},"children":[{"data":{"id":"dldtwvnpt280","created":1789266145382,"text":"手工法：采血2mL,置于抗凝管中，取血加入压积管，经3000转离心30分钟,读取刻度数","layout":null},"children":[]}]},{"data":{"id":"dldtx2u02q80","created":1789266160999,"text":"参考值","layout":null},"children":[{"data":{"id":"dldtxfag9wg0","created":1789266188115,"text":"  成年男性： 0.40 ～0.50","layout":null},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"dldtxhmwhi00","created":1789266193222,"text":"    成年女性： 0.37 ～0.48","layout":null},"children":[]}]},{"data":{"id":"dldtxko8y3k0","created":1789266199834,"text":"临床意义：","layout":null},"children":[{"data":{"id":"dldtxv5ticg0","created":1789266222664,"text":" 相对值：在纠正水电介质平衡时作为参考","layout":null},"children":[{"data":{"id":"dldtxyvgitk0","created":1789266230745,"text":"      增高：真性RBC增多症","layout":null},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"dldtyclcaao0","created":1789266260608,"text":"减低：见于各种贫血","layout":null},"children":[]}]},{"data":{"id":"dldtydyf02g0","created":1789266263575,"text":"绝对值：可作为治疗效果观察的指标","font-weight":"bold","layout":null},"children":[{"data":{"id":"dldtyoehkbc0","created":1789266286315,"text":"   增高：真性RBC增多症","layout":null},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"dldtyqmjneo0","created":1789266291155,"text":"      减低：见于各种贫血","layout":null},"children":[]}]}]}]}]},{"data":{"id":"dldv2zcg7ug0","created":1789269444703,"text":"质的检测","layout":null,"expandState":"collapse"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"dldv33rol940","created":1789269454331,"text":"平均红细胞血红蛋白含量（mean corpuscular\nhemoglobin, MCH）\n每个RBC内的Hb平均含量","font-weight":"bold","layout":null,"expandState":"expand"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"dldv3frbftc0","created":1789269480430,"text":"公式：MCH=每升血液中HGB含量g/每升血液中RBC数量（10^{12}/L)}pg\n150/5=30pg\n \t","layout":null},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"dldv3vlew680","created":1789269514902,"text":" 参考值：27~31pg","layout":null},"children":[]}]},{"data":{"id":"dldv4k5fwtk0","created":1789269568355,"text":"平均红细胞体积（mean corpuscular volume,MCV）\n指每个RBC体积的平均值","font-weight":"bold","layout":null},"children":[{"data":{"id":"dldv534gonk0","created":1789269609655,"text":"公式：MCV=每升血液中RBC的体积HCT /每升血液中RBC数量（10^{12}/L)}fL\n0.45/5=90fL","layout":null},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"dldv5j63ie80","created":1789269644582,"text":"  参考值：82~92fL","layout":null},"children":[]}]},{"data":{"id":"dldv5ncgrl40","created":1789269653675,"text":"平均红细胞血红蛋白浓度（mean corpuscular\nhemoglobin concentration, MCHC）\n指每升红细胞比积容量所含血红蛋白的浓度","font-weight":"bold","layout":null},"children":[{"data":{"id":"dldv6fxq5q80","created":1789269715910,"text":"公式：MCHC=MCH/MCV=HGB/HCT（g/L）\n150/0.45=333g/L","layout":null},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"dldv6ibmq6w0","created":1789269721104,"text":"参考值：320~360g/L(330)","layout":null},"children":[]}]},{"data":{"id":"dldv6mkp1eg0","created":1789269730360,"text":"红细胞体积分布宽度测定(RDW)\n是反映外周血中红细胞体积异质性的参数","font-weight":"bold","layout":null},"children":[{"data":{"id":"dldv8373l340","created":1789269844907,"text":"公式：RDW=红细胞体积的标准差SD/平均红细胞体积MCV*100%","layout":null},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"dldv8abpmkg0","created":1789269860423,"text":"参考值：11.5~14.5%","layout":null},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"dldv8chogtc0","created":1789269865138,"text":"临床意义：升高表示红细胞大小差异较大（红细胞大小不均）","layout":null},"children":[]}]}]},{"data":{"id":"dldv8mztj4g0","created":1789269888003,"text":"其他检测：网织红细胞相关检测","layout":null,"expandState":"collapse"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"dldv9151kfc0","created":1789269918793,"text":"网织红细胞计数(Reticulocyte count, Ret )\n晚幼红细胞脱核后到完全成熟红细胞之间的过渡型细胞","font-weight":"bold","layout":null,"expandState":"expand"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"dldv9cxgnio0","created":1789269944456,"text":"原理：由于网织红细胞胞浆中仍残留有核糖体等碱性物质，用煌焦油蓝染液进行活体染色时，可出现蓝紫色网状（或颗粒状）结构，故为网织红细胞","layout":null},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"dldv9j1jcko0","created":1789269957763,"text":"参考值","layout":null},"children":[{"data":{"id":"dldv9suo2fs0","created":1789269979116,"text":"    成人：0.5～1.5%\n ","layout":null},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"dldv9vaesr40","created":1789269984421,"text":"     新生儿：3～6%\n   ","layout":null},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"dldv9xxpo1s0","created":1789269990184,"text":"   绝对值：24～84×10^9/ L","layout":null},"children":[]}]},{"data":{"id":"dldva0c8olk0","created":1789269995416,"text":"临床意义\n判断骨髓红细胞系统造血情况","layout":null},"children":[{"data":{"id":"dldvabms4x40","created":1789270019998,"text":"\t  造血旺盛","layout":null},"children":[{"data":{"id":"dldvaryk69c0","created":1789270055539,"text":"溶血：缺氧及红细胞破坏产物剌激骨髓造血，大量年轻的红细胞入血。Ret 5～20% ；急性溶血时达50～70%","layout":null},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"dldvb2ou9iw0","created":1789270078896,"text":"急性大失血：Ret明显升高","layout":null},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"dldvb5p8gi80","created":1789270085450,"text":"缺铁性贫血：Ret轻度增多","layout":null},"children":[]}]},{"data":{"id":"dldvawh59cw0","created":1789270065370,"text":"造血功能低下：再障患者的网织红细胞 <0.15%","layout":null},"children":[]}]}]}]},{"data":{"id":"dldvbbxpqgo0","created":1789270099023,"text":"贫血","image":"https://github.com/123fu-hub/iodraw-files/blob/main/%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%871.png","imageTitle":"","imageSize":{"width":0,"height":0},"hyperlink":"https://github.com/123fu-hub/iodraw-files/blob/main/%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%871.png","hyperlinkTitle":"","layout":null},"children":[{"data":{"id":"dldze3o8u5k0","created":1789281600568,"text":"定义：各种原因导致的外周血红细胞容量低于正常的临床综合征，在一定容积的循环血液内BRC、HGB、HCT均低于正常标准者","layout":null},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"dldzemd7gts0","created":1789281641260,"text":"分度","layout":null},"children":[{"data":{"id":"dldzeqqf8b40","created":1789281650766,"text":"根据病因","layout":null},"children":[{"data":{"id":"dldzeuzczts0","created":1789281660014,"text":"丢多","layout":null},"children":[{"data":{"id":"dldzf8ivmhc0","created":1789281689492,"text":"    血液整体丢失（失血）\n  ","layout":null},"children":[{"data":{"id":"dldzfte0sgw0","created":1789281734911,"text":"急性失血：手术、创伤","layout":null},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"dldzfw21pzs0","created":1789281740717,"text":"慢性失血：钩虫、痔疮、月经过多","layout":null},"children":[]}]},{"data":{"id":"dldzffyzng00","created":1789281705704,"text":"    RBC过量破坏（溶血）","layout":null},"children":[{"data":{"id":"dldzfzro5sg0","created":1789281748797,"text":"内在缺陷：膜、酶、HGB","layout":null},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"dldzg29obq80","created":1789281754239,"text":"外在攻击：抗体、补体","layout":null},"children":[]}]}]},{"data":{"id":"dldzg4x1e1k0","created":1789281760005,"text":"产少：RBC生成不足","layout":null},"children":[{"data":{"id":"dldzg7uto340","created":1789281766402,"text":"原料不足：缺铁、缺叶酸B12","layout":null},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"dldzgkh0fa80","created":1789281793865,"text":"   生成障碍：骨髓衰竭（再障）","layout":null},"children":[]}]}]},{"data":{"id":"dldzgnkkiq00","created":1789281800610,"text":"根据细胞形态","layout":null},"children":[{"data":{"id":"dldzgrs2hpc0","created":1789281809771,"text":"外周血细胞形态：正细胞正色素、大细胞、小细胞、小细胞低色素","layout":null},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"dldzh8mqqao0","created":1789281846454,"text":"正细胞正色素：红细胞大小正常（MCV 正常）\n血红蛋白含量正常（MCH、MCHC 正常），\n也就是单个红细胞体积和里面的血红蛋白浓度都没有下降，只是红细胞总数量减少","font-weight":"bold","layout":null,"layout_right_offset":{"x":112,"y":1},"hyperlink":"https://github.com/123fu-hub/iodraw-files/commit/c14bcd8600c0f990813bcd7f999691010aa80eb4","hyperlinkTitle":""},"children":[]}]},{"data":{"id":"dldzk1iyer40","created":1789282066080,"text":"实验室检测","layout":null},"children":[{"data":{"id":"dldzk5seup40","created":1789282075359,"text":"溶血性贫血HA","layout":null},"children":[{"data":{"id":"dldzkdslyyg0","created":1789282092786,"text":"      特点：红细胞生存时间缩短，红细胞破坏增多或加速，\n超过骨髓代偿能力属于，正细胞、正色素性贫血","layout":null},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"dldzkp9rels0","created":1789282117767,"text":"分类"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"dldzkx77h2g0","created":1789282135027,"text":"有内在缺陷（遗传性）"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"dldzlllszco0","created":1789282188152,"text":"  膜缺陷：遗传性球形细胞增多症、阵发性睡眠行血红蛋白尿（PNH）"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"dldzlrak5ls0","created":1789282200533,"text":"酶缺陷：蚕豆病"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"dldzm7nspso0","created":1789282236162,"text":"HGB缺陷：地中海贫血、镰刀型贫血"},"children":[]}]},{"data":{"id":"dldzmd589880","created":1789282248100,"text":" 受外在攻击"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"dldzmfuaf8o0","created":1789282253969,"text":" \t"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"dldzmiivna00","created":1789282259809,"text":" 非免疫性"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"dldzmvb3uow0","created":1789282287637,"text":"分支主题"},"children":[]}]}]}]}]}]}]}]}]},"template":"default","theme":"fresh-blue","version":"1.4.43"}